@owner: mason
@stability: stable
@since: 2026-06-09
@reviewed: 2026-06-09

Feature: Share URL Construction
  "Builds long object-path URLs and served short slug URLs from a target base_url."

  Provides:
    - domain.ObjectURL @source("symbol:ObjectURL")
    - domain.SlugURL @source("symbol:SlugURL")

  Invariants:
    - ObjectURL MUST join baseURL and objectPath with a single slash boundary
    - SlugURL MUST serve at {baseURL}/s/{slug}{ext} so the web server infers Content-Type from ext

  Scenario (happy-path): Long URL
    Given base https://share.example.com and path inbox/foo.mp3
    When ObjectURL runs
    Then it returns https://share.example.com/inbox/foo.mp3

  Scenario (happy-path): Short URL with extension
    Given base https://share.example.com, slug f76, and ext .mp3
    When SlugURL runs
    Then it returns https://share.example.com/s/f76.mp3
